  2472	 * xmlXIncludeSetFlags:
  2473	 * @ctxt:  an XInclude processing context
  2474	 * @flags: a set of xmlParserOption used for parsing XML includes
  2475	 *
  2476	 * Set the flags used for further processing of XML resources.
  2477	 *
  2478	 * Returns 0 in case of success and -1 in case of error.
